2488-36617-0083 V:0.5419 A:0.4480 D:0.5563 WITH ALL DUE RESPECT TO MASTER CONSEIL REPLIED AS COMFORTABLE AS A HERMIT CRAB INSIDE THE SHELL OF A WHELK
2488-36617-0084 V:0.5389 A:0.4752 D:0.5758 JUST THEN COMMANDER FARRAGUT WAS GIVING ORDERS TO CAST OFF THE LAST MOORINGS HOLDING THE ABRAHAM LINCOLN TO ITS BROOKLYN PIER
2488-36617-0085 V:0.4532 A:0.4361 D:0.5279 AND SO IF ID BEEN DELAYED BY A QUARTER OF AN HOUR OR EVEN LESS THE FRIGATE WOULD HAVE GONE WITHOUT ME AND I WOULD HAVE MISSED OUT ON THIS UNEARTHLY EXTRAORDINARY AND INCONCEIVABLE EXPEDITION WHOSE TRUE STORY MIGHT WELL MEET WITH SOME SKEPTICISM
2488-36617-0086 V:0.3538 A:0.3712 D:0.4867 BUT COMMANDER FARRAGUT DIDNT WANT TO WASTE A SINGLE DAY
2488-36617-0087 V:0.5674 A:0.4903 D:0.5529 AT THIS ORDER WHICH WAS RELAYED TO THE ENGINE BY MEANS OF A COMPRESSED AIR DEVICE THE MECHANICS ACTIVATED THE START UP WHEEL
2488-36617-0088 V:0.4910 A:0.4564 D:0.5275 STEAM RUSHED WHISTLING INTO THE GAPING VALVES
2488-36617-0089 V:0.4117 A:0.4471 D:0.5396 LONG HORIZONTAL PISTONS GROANED AND PUSHED THE TIE RODS OF THE DRIVE SHAFT
2488-36617-0090 V:0.6456 A:0.4753 D:0.5565 THE BLADES OF THE PROPELLER CHURNED THE WAVES WITH INCREASING SPEED AND THE ABRAHAM LINCOLN MOVED OUT MAJESTICALLY AMID A SPECTATOR LADEN ESCORT OF SOME ONE HUNDRED FERRIES AND TENDERS AUTHORS NOTE TENDERS ARE SMALL STEAMBOATS THAT ASSIST THE BIG LINERS
2488-36617-0091 V:0.4819 A:0.4040 D:0.5163 THE WHARVES OF BROOKLYN AND EVERY PART OF NEW YORK BORDERING THE EAST RIVER WERE CROWDED WITH CURIOSITY SEEKERS
2488-36617-0092 V:0.4897 A:0.4461 D:0.5475 DEPARTING FROM FIVE HUNDRED THOUSAND THROATS THREE CHEERS BURST FORTH IN SUCCESSION
2488-36617-0093 V:0.5304 A:0.4214 D:0.5124 THOUSANDS OF HANDKERCHIEFS WERE WAVING ABOVE THESE TIGHTLY PACKED MASSES HAILING THE ABRAHAM LINCOLN UNTIL IT REACHED THE WATERS OF THE HUDSON RIVER AT THE TIP OF THE LONG PENINSULA THAT FORMS NEW YORK CITY
2488-36617-0094 V:0.6782 A:0.4777 D:0.5745 THE WONDERFUL RIGHT BANK OF THIS RIVER ALL LOADED DOWN WITH COUNTRY HOMES AND PASSED BY THE FORTS TO SALUTES FROM THEIR BIGGEST CANNONS
2488-36617-0095 V:0.4717 A:0.4355 D:0.5232 WHOSE THIRTY NINE STARS GLEAMED FROM THE GAFF OF THE MIZZEN SAIL IT HUGGED THIS SAND COVERED STRIP OF LAND WHERE THOUSANDS OF SPECTATORS ACCLAIMED US ONE MORE TIME
2488-36619-0001 V:0.4058 A:0.3360 D:0.4363 FOR SOME WHILE THE VOYAGE OF THE ABRAHAM LINCOLN WAS MARKED BY NO INCIDENT
2488-36619-0002 V:0.6955 A:0.4258 D:0.5468 BUT ONE CIRCUMSTANCE AROSE THAT DISPLAYED NED LANDS MARVELOUS SKILLS AND SHOWED JUST HOW MUCH CONFIDENCE WE COULD PLACE IN HIM
2488-36619-0003 V:0.4701 A:0.4208 D:0.5243 OFF THE FALKLAND ISLANDS ON JUNE THIRTIETH THE FRIGATE CAME IN CONTACT WITH A FLEET OF AMERICAN WHALERS AND WE LEARNED THAT THEY HADNT SEEN THE NARWHALE
2488-36619-0004 V:0.5160 A:0.4195 D:0.5103 BUT ONE OF THEM THE CAPTAIN OF THE MONROE
2488-36619-0005 V:0.6134 A:0.4631 D:0.5488 ANXIOUS TO SEE NED LAND AT WORK COMMANDER FARRAGUT AUTHORIZED HIM TO MAKE HIS WAY ABOARD THE MONROE
2488-36619-0006 V:0.5247 A:0.4897 D:0.5736 AND THE CANADIAN HAD SUCH GOOD LUCK THAT WITH A RIGHT AND LEFT SHOT HE HARPOONED NOT ONE WHALE BUT TWO STRIKING THE FIRST STRAIGHT TO THE HEART AND CATCHING THE OTHER AFTER A FEW MINUTES CHASE
2488-36619-0007 V:0.3946 A:0.4255 D:0.5328 ASSUREDLY IF THE MONSTER EVER HAD TO DEAL WITH NED LANDS HARPOON I WOULDNT BET ON THE MONSTER
2488-36619-0008 V:0.5659 A:0.4551 D:0.5459 THE FRIGATE SAILED ALONG THE EAST COAST OF SOUTH AMERICA WITH PRODIGIOUS SPEED
2488-36619-0009 V:0.5820 A:0.4041 D:0.5109 BY JULY THIRD WE WERE AT THE ENTRANCE TO THE STRAIT OF MAGELLAN ABREAST OF CABO DE LAS VIRGENES
2488-36619-0010 V:0.5433 A:0.4009 D:0.4923 AND MANEUVERED INSTEAD TO DOUBLE CAPE HORN
2488-36619-0011 V:0.4935 A:0.3695 D:0.5002 THE CREW SIDED WITH HIM UNANIMOUSLY
2488-36619-0012 V:0.3429 A:0.4116 D:0.5030 INDEED WERE WE LIKELY TO ENCOUNTER THE NARWHALE IN SUCH A CRAMPED STRAIT
2488-36619-0013 V:0.3696 A:0.4381 D:0.5287 MANY OF OUR SAILORS SWORE THAT THE MONSTER COULDNT NEGOTIATE THIS PASSAGEWAY SIMPLY BECAUSE HES TOO BIG FOR IT
2488-36619-0014 V:0.5583 A:0.4042 D:0.5093 NEAR THREE OCLOCK IN THE AFTERNOON ON JULY SIXTH FIFTEEN MILES SOUTH OF SHORE THE ABRAHAM LINCOLN DOUBLED THAT SOLITARY ISLET AT THE TIP OF THE SOUTH AMERICAN CONTINENT THAT STRAY ROCK DUTCH SEAMEN HAD NAMED CAPE HORN AFTER THEIR HOMETOWN OF HOORN
2488-36619-0015 V:0.5631 A:0.4194 D:0.5154 OUR COURSE WAS SET FOR THE NORTHWEST AND THE NEXT DAY OUR FRIGATES PROPELLER FINALLY CHURNED THE WATERS OF THE PACIFIC
2488-36619-0016 V:0.5406 A:0.4663 D:0.5503 OPEN YOUR EYES
2488-36619-0017 V:0.5676 A:0.5443 D:0.6119 OPEN YOUR EYES
2488-36619-0018 V:0.5092 A:0.3677 D:0.4746 REPEATED THE SAILORS OF THE ABRAHAM LINCOLN
2488-36619-0019 V:0.7334 A:0.4569 D:0.5385 AND THEY OPENED AMAZINGLY WIDE
2488-36619-0020 V:0.5191 A:0.4404 D:0.5240 EYES AND SPYGLASSES A BIT DAZZLED IT IS TRUE BY THE VISTA OF TWO THOUSAND DOLLARS DIDNT REMAIN AT REST FOR AN INSTANT
2488-36619-0021 V:0.6091 A:0.4324 D:0.5131 DAY AND NIGHT WE OBSERVED THE SURFACE OF THE OCEAN AND THOSE WITH NYCTALOPIC EYES WHOSE ABILITY TO SEE IN THE DARK INCREASED THEIR CHANCES BY FIFTY PERCENT
2488-36619-0022 V:0.3687 A:0.4988 D:0.5630 I NO LONGER LEFT THE SHIPS DECK
2488-36619-0023 V:0.4498 A:0.3952 D:0.4828 SOMETIMES BENDING OVER THE FORECASTLE RAILINGS SOMETIMES LEANING AGAINST THE STERNRAIL
2488-36619-0024 V:0.5342 A:0.4712 D:0.5478 AND HOW MANY TIMES I SHARED THE EXCITEMENT OF GENERAL STAFF AND CREW WHEN SOME UNPREDICTABLE WHALE LIFTED ITS BLACKISH BACK ABOVE THE WAVES
2488-36619-0025 V:0.4931 A:0.3974 D:0.4891 IN AN INSTANT THE FRIGATES DECK WOULD BECOME DENSELY POPULATED
2488-36619-0026 V:0.3059 A:0.4307 D:0.5088 THE COWLS OVER THE COMPANIONWAYS WOULD VOMIT A TORRENT OF SAILORS AND OFFICERS
2488-36619-0027 V:0.5291 A:0.4334 D:0.5165 WITH PANTING CHESTS AND ANXIOUS EYES WE EACH WOULD OBSERVE THE CETACEANS MOVEMENTS
2488-36619-0028 V:0.3956 A:0.3987 D:0.4854 I STARED I STARED UNTIL I NEARLY WENT BLIND FROM A WORN OUT RETINA WHILE CONSEIL AS STOIC AS EVER KEPT REPEATING TO ME IN A CALM TONE IF MASTERS EYES WOULD KINDLY STOP BULGING MASTER WILL SEE FARTHER
2488-36619-0029 V:0.3419 A:0.3882 D:0.4800 BUT WHAT A WASTE OF ENERGY
2488-36619-0030 V:0.3818 A:0.3872 D:0.4914 THE ABRAHAM LINCOLN WOULD CHANGE COURSE AND RACE AFTER THE ANIMAL SIGHTED ONLY TO FIND AN ORDINARY BALEEN WHALE OR A COMMON SPERM WHALE THAT SOON DISAPPEARED AMID A CHORUS OF CURSES
2488-36619-0031 V:0.4833 A:0.3425 D:0.4587 HOWEVER THE WEATHER HELD GOOD
2488-36619-0032 V:0.4766 A:0.3501 D:0.4845 OUR VOYAGE WAS PROCEEDING UNDER THE MOST FAVORABLE CONDITIONS
2488-36619-0033 V:0.4691 A:0.3822 D:0.4803 BY THEN IT WAS THE BAD SEASON IN THESE SOUTHERNMOST REGIONS BECAUSE JULY IN THIS ZONE CORRESPONDS TO OUR JANUARY IN EUROPE BUT THE SEA REMAINED SMOOTH AND EASILY VISIBLE OVER A VAST PERIMETER
2488-36619-0034 V:0.2517 A:0.3739 D:0.5185 NED LAND STILL KEPT UP THE MOST TENACIOUS SKEPTICISM
2488-36619-0035 V:0.4430 A:0.4496 D:0.5483 BUT THIS STUBBORN CANADIAN SPENT EIGHT HOURS OUT OF EVERY TWELVE READING OR SLEEPING IN HIS CABIN
2488-36619-0036 V:0.5843 A:0.4935 D:0.5752 A HUNDRED TIMES I CHIDED HIM FOR HIS UNCONCERN
2488-36619-0037 V:0.3928 A:0.3081 D:0.3842 BAH
2488-36619-0038 V:0.5126 A:0.4751 D:0.5504 HE REPLIED NOTHINGS OUT THERE PROFESSOR ARONNAX AND IF THERE IS SOME ANIMAL WHAT CHANCE WOULD WE HAVE OF SPOTTING IT
2488-36619-0039 V:0.3769 A:0.4087 D:0.4923 CANT YOU SEE WERE JUST WANDERING AROUND AT RANDOM
2488-36619-0040 V:0.3506 A:0.4446 D:0.5576 PEOPLE SAY THEYVE SIGHTED THIS SLIPPERY BEAST AGAIN IN THE PACIFIC HIGH SEAS IM TRULY WILLING TO BELIEVE IT BUT TWO MONTHS HAVE ALREADY GONE BY SINCE THEN AND JUDGING BY YOUR NARWHALES PERSONALITY IT HATES GROWING MOLDY FROM HANGING OUT TOO LONG IN THE SAME WATERWAYS
2488-36619-0041 V:0.7718 A:0.4503 D:0.5681 ITS BLESSED WITH A TERRIFIC GIFT FOR GETTING AROUND
2488-36619-0042 V:0.3535 A:0.4282 D:0.5449 NOW PROFESSOR YOU KNOW EVEN BETTER THAN I THAT NATURE DOESNT VIOLATE GOOD SENSE
2488-36619-0043 V:0.5032 A:0.3854 D:0.5061 THESE BEARINGS DETERMINED THE FRIGATE TOOK A MORE DECISIVE WESTWARD HEADING AND TACKLED THE SEAS OF THE CENTRAL PACIFIC
2488-36619-0044 V:0.4965 A:0.3944 D:0.4953 COMMANDER FARRAGUT FELT AND WITH GOOD REASON THAT IT WAS BEST TO STAY IN DEEP WATERS AND KEEP HIS DISTANCE FROM CONTINENTS OR ISLANDS NO DOUBT OUR BOSUN SAID BECAUSE THERE ISNT ENOUGH WATER FOR HIM
2488-36619-0045 V:0.5336 A:0.4485 D:0.5415 THEN CUT THE TROPIC OF CANCER AT LONGITUDE ONE HUNDRED THIRTY TWO DEGREES AND HEADED FOR THE SEAS OF CHINA
2488-36619-0046 V:0.5403 A:0.3745 D:0.4916 WE WERE FINALLY IN THE AREA OF THE MONSTERS LATEST ANTICS
2488-36619-0047 V:0.2585 A:0.4296 D:0.5337 AND IN ALL HONESTY SHIPBOARD CONDITIONS BECAME LIFE THREATENING
2488-36619-0048 V:0.2585 A:0.4324 D:0.5266 HEARTS WERE POUNDING HIDEOUSLY
2488-36619-0049 V:0.2880 A:0.4208 D:0.4783 NOBODY ATE NOBODY SLEPT
2488-36619-0050 V:0.3587 A:0.3688 D:0.4777 TWENTY TIMES A DAY SOME ERROR IN PERCEPTION OR THE OPTICAL ILLUSIONS OF SOME SAILOR PERCHED IN THE CROSSTREES WOULD CAUSE INTOLERABLE ANGUISH AND THIS EMOTION REPEATED TWENTY TIMES OVER KEPT US IN A STATE OF IRRITABILITY SO INTENSE THAT A REACTION WAS BOUND TO FOLLOW
2488-36619-0051 V:0.3555 A:0.3659 D:0.4863 AND THIS REACTION WASNT LONG IN COMING
2488-36619-0052 V:0.4311 A:0.4172 D:0.5067 FOR THREE MONTHS DURING WHICH EACH DAY SEEMED LIKE A CENTURY THE ABRAHAM LINCOLN PLOWED ALL THE NORTHERLY SEAS OF THE PACIFIC RACING AFTER WHALES SIGHTED ABRUPTLY VEERING OFF COURSE SWERVING SHARPLY FROM ONE TACK TO ANOTHER STOPPING SUDDENLY PUTTING ON STEAM AND REVERSING ENGINES IN QUICK SUCCESSION AT THE RISK OF STRIPPING ITS GEARS AND IT DIDNT LEAVE A SINGLE POINT UNEXPLORED FROM THE BEACHES OF JAPAN TO THE COASTS OF AMERICA
2488-36619-0053 V:0.3357 A:0.4257 D:0.4936 AND WE FOUND NOTHING
2488-36619-0054 V:0.4052 A:0.4609 D:0.5367 NOTHING EXCEPT AN IMMENSENESS OF DESERTED WAVES
2488-36619-0055 V:0.4900 A:0.4329 D:0.4988 NOTHING REMOTELY RESEMBLING A GIGANTIC NARWHALE OR AN UNDERWATER ISLET
2488-36619-0056 V:0.3521 A:0.4391 D:0.5406 AND EACH MAN NOW WANTED ONLY TO CATCH UP ON HIS EATING AND SLEEPING TO MAKE UP FOR THE TIME HE HAD SO STUPIDLY SACRIFICED
2488-36619-0057 V:0.3801 A:0.4722 D:0.5844 WITH TYPICAL HUMAN FICKLENESS THEY JUMPED FROM ONE EXTREME TO THE OTHER
2488-36619-0058 V:0.6489 A:0.4811 D:0.5763 INEVITABLY THE MOST ENTHUSIASTIC SUPPORTERS OF THE UNDERTAKING BECAME ITS MOST ENERGETIC OPPONENTS
2488-36619-0059 V:0.5084 A:0.4260 D:0.5183 THIS REACTION MOUNTED UPWARD FROM THE BOWELS OF THE SHIP FROM THE QUARTERS OF THE BUNKER HANDS TO THE MESSROOM OF THE GENERAL STAFF AND FOR CERTAIN IF IT HADNT BEEN FOR COMMANDER FARRAGUTS CHARACTERISTIC STUBBORNNESS THE FRIGATE WOULD ULTIMATELY HAVE PUT BACK TO THAT CAPE IN THE SOUTH
2488-36619-0060 V:0.5177 A:0.4137 D:0.5498 NEVER HAD THE CREW OF AN AMERICAN NAVAL CRAFT SHOWN MORE PATIENCE AND ZEAL
2488-36619-0061 V:0.4998 A:0.3962 D:0.5010 A REQUEST TO THIS EFFECT WAS PRESENTED TO THE COMMANDER
2488-36619-0062 V:0.4072 A:0.4033 D:0.5061 THE COMMANDER STOOD HIS GROUND
2488-36619-0063 V:0.2746 A:0.3834 D:0.5013 HIS SAILORS COULDNT HIDE THEIR DISCONTENT AND THEIR WORK SUFFERED BECAUSE OF IT
2488-36619-0064 V:0.2890 A:0.4466 D:0.5531 IM UNWILLING TO SAY THAT THERE WAS MUTINY ON BOARD
2488-36619-0065 V:0.4859 A:0.3404 D:0.4564 AND THE ABRAHAM LINCOLN WOULD CHART A COURSE TOWARD EUROPEAN SEAS
2488-36619-0066 V:0.4429 A:0.3565 D:0.4782 THIS PROMISE WAS GIVEN ON NOVEMBER SECOND
2488-36619-0067 V:0.4967 A:0.4180 D:0.5213 IT HAD THE IMMEDIATE EFFECT OF REVIVING THE CREWS FAILING SPIRITS
2488-36619-0068 V:0.4793 A:0.3710 D:0.4588 THE OCEAN WAS OBSERVED WITH RENEWED CARE
2488-36619-0069 V:0.5836 A:0.4370 D:0.5250 EACH MAN WANTED ONE LAST LOOK WITH WHICH TO SUM UP HIS EXPERIENCE
2488-36619-0070 V:0.5626 A:0.5029 D:0.5921 SPYGLASSES FUNCTIONED WITH FEVERISH ENERGY
2488-36619-0071 V:0.4618 A:0.4495 D:0.5438 A SUPREME CHALLENGE HAD BEEN ISSUED TO THE GIANT NARWHALE AND THE LATTER HAD NO ACCEPTABLE EXCUSE FOR IGNORING THIS SUMMONS TO APPEAR
2488-36619-0072 V:0.4094 A:0.4052 D:0.4940 TWO DAYS PASSED
2488-36619-0073 V:0.4610 A:0.3396 D:0.4510 THE ABRAHAM LINCOLN STAYED AT HALF STEAM
2488-36619-0074 V:0.4611 A:0.4115 D:0.5219 A THOUSAND METHODS WERE USED TO SPARK ITS INTEREST OR ROUSE IT FROM ITS APATHY
2488-36619-0075 V:0.5298 A:0.4306 D:0.5401 ENORMOUS SIDES OF BACON WERE TRAILED IN OUR WAKE TO THE GREAT SATISFACTION I MUST SAY OF ASSORTED SHARKS
2488-36619-0076 V:0.4636 A:0.4207 D:0.4984 WHILE THE ABRAHAM LINCOLN HEAVED TO ITS LONGBOATS RADIATED IN EVERY DIRECTION AROUND IT AND DIDNT LEAVE A SINGLE POINT OF THE SEA UNEXPLORED
2488-36619-0077 V:0.4897 A:0.3271 D:0.4393 BUT THE EVENING OF NOVEMBER FOURTH ARRIVED WITH THIS UNDERWATER MYSTERY STILL UNSOLVED BY
2488-36619-0081 V:0.4461 A:0.3712 D:0.4790 THE SHORES OF JAPAN WERE LESS THAN TWO HUNDRED MILES TO OUR LEEWARD
2488-36619-0082 V:0.3934 A:0.3376 D:0.4331 NIGHT WAS COMING ON
2488-36619-0083 V:0.4266 A:0.3653 D:0.4716 EIGHT OCLOCK HAD JUST STRUCK
2488-36619-0084 V:0.5268 A:0.3798 D:0.4599 HUGE CLOUDS COVERED THE MOONS DISK THEN IN ITS FIRST QUARTER
2488-36619-0085 V:0.5316 A:0.3674 D:0.4537 THE SEA UNDULATED PLACIDLY BENEATH THE FRIGATES STEMPOST
2488-36619-0086 V:0.5278 A:0.4347 D:0.5111 JUST THEN I WAS IN THE BOW LEANING OVER THE STARBOARD RAIL
2488-36619-0087 V:0.4545 A:0.4211 D:0.5048 CONSEIL STATIONED BESIDE ME STARED STRAIGHT AHEAD
2488-36619-0088 V:0.3973 A:0.3637 D:0.4527 ROOSTING IN THE SHROUDS THE CREW EXAMINED THE HORIZON WHICH SHRANK AND DARKENED LITTLE BY LITTLE
2488-36619-0089 V:0.4566 A:0.4024 D:0.4945 OFFICERS WERE PROBING THE INCREASING GLOOM WITH THEIR NIGHT GLASSES
2488-36619-0090 V:0.5814 A:0.4073 D:0.4839 SOMETIMES THE MURKY OCEAN SPARKLED BENEATH MOONBEAMS THAT DARTED BETWEEN THE FRINGES OF TWO CLOUDS
2488-36619-0091 V:0.3924 A:0.3249 D:0.4176 THEN ALL TRACES OF LIGHT VANISHED INTO THE DARKNESS
2488-36619-0092 V:0.5883 A:0.4512 D:0.5640 OBSERVING CONSEIL I DISCOVERED THAT JUST BARELY THE GALLANT LAD HAD FALLEN UNDER THE GENERAL INFLUENCE
2488-36619-0093 V:0.4222 A:0.3244 D:0.3863 AT LEAST SO I THOUGHT
2488-36619-0094 V:0.5359 A:0.4423 D:0.5375 PERHAPS HIS NERVES WERE TWITCHING WITH CURIOSITY FOR THE FIRST TIME IN HISTORY
2488-36619-0096 V:0.4704 A:0.4076 D:0.5155 IF MASTER WILL PERMIT MY SAYING SO CONSEIL REPLIED I NEVER EXPECTED TO WIN THAT PRIZE
2488-36619-0097 V:0.5044 A:0.4171 D:0.4922 IN MASTERS LITTLE APARTMENT CONSEIL ANSWERED IN MASTERS MUSEUM
2488-36619-0098 V:0.5270 A:0.3534 D:0.4539 AND IT WOULD HAVE ATTRACTED EVERY CURIOSITY SEEKER IN TOWN
2488-36619-0100 V:0.5325 A:0.3923 D:0.4956 TO BE SURE CONSEIL REPLIED SERENELY I DO THINK THEYLL HAVE FUN AT MASTERS EXPENSE
2488-36619-0101 V:0.2544 A:0.3274 D:0.4205 AND MUST IT BE SAID
2488-36619-0102 V:0.1784 A:0.2460 D:0.3739 IT MUST BE SAID CONSEIL
2488-36619-0103 V:0.4448 A:0.3032 D:0.4177 WELL THEN IT WILL SERVE MASTER RIGHT
2488-36619-0104 V:0.6166 A:0.4238 D:0.5470 HOW TRUE
2488-36619-0105 V:0.4579 A:0.4255 D:0.5271 WHEN ONE HAS THE HONOR OF BEING AN EXPERT AS MASTER IS ONE MUSTNT LAY HIMSELF OPEN TO CONSEIL DIDNT HAVE TIME TO COMPLETE THE COMPLIMENT
2488-36619-0106 V:0.5254 A:0.4422 D:0.5351 IN THE MIDST OF THE GENERAL SILENCE A VOICE BECAME AUDIBLE
2609-39660-0000 V:0.4067 A:0.2803 D:0.4128 COLBERT REAPPEARED BENEATH THE CURTAINS
2609-39660-0001 V:0.2696 A:0.4046 D:0.5070 HAVE YOU HEARD
2609-39660-0002 V:0.2553 A:0.2147 D:0.3358 SAID MAZARIN
2609-39660-0003 V:0.2272 A:0.3557 D:0.4560 ALAS
2609-39660-0004 V:0.5935 A:0.4070 D:0.5358 YES MY LORD
2609-39660-0005 V:0.2675 A:0.4481 D:0.5350 CAN HE BE RIGHT
2609-39660-0006 V:0.1875 A:0.4692 D:0.6005 CAN ALL THIS MONEY BE BADLY ACQUIRED
2609-39660-0007 V:0.2924 A:0.2717 D:0.3874 REPLIED COLBERT COOLLY
2609-39660-0008 V:0.5125 A:0.4418 D:0.5531 AND YET IT IS VERY POSSIBLE THAT ACCORDING TO HIS THEOLOGICAL VIEWS YOUR EMINENCE HAS BEEN IN A CERTAIN DEGREE IN THE WRONG
2609-39660-0010 V:0.2212 A:0.3779 D:0.5194 IN THE FIRST PLACE THEY COMMIT THE WRONG OF DYING COLBERT
2609-39660-0011 V:0.4238 A:0.3845 D:0.5241 THAT IS TRUE MY LORD
2609-39660-0013 V:0.2504 A:0.5619 D:0.6197 AGAINST THE KING
2609-39660-0014 V:0.2584 A:0.3370 D:0.4592 MAZARIN SHRUGGED HIS SHOULDERS
2609-39660-0015 V:0.3738 A:0.3766 D:0.5002 AS IF I HAD NOT SAVED BOTH HIS STATE AND HIS FINANCES
2609-39660-0016 V:0.3334 A:0.4038 D:0.5338 THAT ADMITS OF NO CONTRADICTION MY LORD
2609-39660-0017 V:0.1137 A:0.5312 D:0.5874 DOES IT
2609-39660-0018 V:0.4521 A:0.4876 D:0.6057 THEN I HAVE RECEIVED A MERELY LEGITIMATE SALARY IN SPITE OF THE OPINION OF MY CONFESSOR
2609-39660-0019 V:0.3328 A:0.3920 D:0.5129 THAT IS BEYOND DOUBT
2609-39660-0020 V:0.5724 A:0.5095 D:0.6156 AND I MIGHT FAIRLY KEEP FOR MY OWN FAMILY WHICH IS SO NEEDY A GOOD FORTUNE THE WHOLE EVEN OF WHICH I HAVE EARNED
2609-39660-0021 V:0.3213 A:0.4823 D:0.5790 I SEE NO IMPEDIMENT TO THAT MONSEIGNEUR
2609-39660-0022 V:0.5808 A:0.4552 D:0.5977 I FELT ASSURED THAT IN CONSULTING YOU COLBERT I SHOULD HAVE GOOD ADVICE REPLIED MAZARIN GREATLY DELIGHTED
2609-39660-0023 V:0.3266 A:0.3301 D:0.4603 COLBERT RESUMED HIS PEDANTIC LOOK
2609-39660-0024 V:0.3533 A:0.4411 D:0.5463 MY LORD INTERRUPTED HE I THINK IT WOULD BE QUITE AS WELL TO EXAMINE WHETHER WHAT THE THEATIN SAID IS NOT A SNARE
2609-39660-0025 V:0.2161 A:0.5122 D:0.5689 OH NO A SNARE WHAT FOR
2609-39660-0026 V:0.4458 A:0.4523 D:0.5543 HE BELIEVED YOUR EMINENCE TO BE AT DEATHS DOOR BECAUSE YOUR EMINENCE CONSULTED HIM DID I NOT HEAR HIM SAY RECOLLECT MY LORD IF HE DID NOT SAY SOMETHING A LITTLE LIKE THAT TO YOU THAT IS QUITE A THEATRICAL SPEECH
2609-39660-0027 V:0.5402 A:0.4601 D:0.5547 THAT IS POSSIBLE
2609-39660-0028 V:0.3846 A:0.5281 D:0.6210 IN WHICH CASE MY LORD I SHOULD CONSIDER YOU AS REQUIRED BY THE THEATIN TO TO MAKE RESTITUTION
2609-39660-0029 V:0.5782 A:0.3345 D:0.4745 CRIED MAZARIN WITH GREAT WARMTH
2609-39660-0031 V:0.2615 A:0.6154 D:0.6999 YOU DO NOT DREAM OF SUCH A THING YOU SPEAK JUST AS THE CONFESSOR DID
2609-39660-0032 V:0.4620 A:0.4738 D:0.5822 TO MAKE RESTITUTION OF A PART THAT IS TO SAY HIS MAJESTYS PART AND THAT MONSEIGNEUR MAY HAVE ITS DANGERS
2609-39660-0033 V:0.4382 A:0.5287 D:0.6363 YOUR EMINENCE IS TOO SKILLFUL A POLITICIAN NOT TO KNOW THAT AT THIS MOMENT
